  m_text: "Thanks for playing our game!\n\nThis was our first game as a team and
    its been really fun, its not perfect by any means but we feel proud of what we
    have created and hope you see our vision. \n\nSince you found this secret, you
    will get a hint on how you can find more of these secrets.\n\n\"The vampires
    guard the treasure\"\n\nWe hope you enjoyed it so far and keep enjoying it. \n\n\nThanks 
    again\nThe devs \n"
